Source page: https://junegunn.github.io/fzf/color-themes/
Pinned preset source: https://github.com/junegunn/junegunn.github.io/blob/8112383a1781605e7b181c5b717327439a0fb981/static/js/fzf-color-themes.js

fzf-gruvbox.opts: exact literal colors of PRESETS['Gruvbox Dark'].
fzf-nord.opts: exact literal colors of PRESETS['Nord'].
These are fzf-upstream presets published by fzf author Junegunn Choi, not
ports published by the Gruvbox or Nord theme authors. No color is calculated,
interpolated, or substituted. Only current-fg/current-bg/current-hl are
renamed to their equivalent stable fg+/bg+/hl+ option names. Every explicitly
specified preset color is retained; no implicit/default colors are generated.
No JavaScript implementation or generator code is bundled.

License status: the pinned junegunn.github.io repository declares no license.
The source site's footer states Copyright (c) 2025 Junegunn Choi. These
literal option/color data are recorded with that provenance; they are NOT
represented as covered by the fzf software's MIT license or by a Gruvbox/Nord
theme license. Those separate project licenses do not license this website.

The page warns that some generator options require fzf 0.73.0. None of those
layout/options features or modern color-key names are emitted here. All keys
used by these two presets, including gutter and fg+/bg+/hl+, are supported by
the fzf 0.24.0 color parser:
https://github.com/junegunn/fzf/blob/0.24.0/src/options.go#L614-L710

The existing Dracula and Moonfly assets retain their original theme-author
ports and licenses; they are not replaced with the site's different presets.
